  T2_standstill_ I1 qdot^T H q   9.2161e-08   6.9134e-08   1.6130e-07   2.1526e-06
  T2_standstill_ I2 qddot^T H q   9.0546e-03   8.8769e-03   1.7769e-04   1.9899e-06
  T2_standstill_ I3 qddot^T H qdot   3.6903e-07   6.5401e-05   6.5032e-05   2.6123e-06
  T2_standstill_ I1 ANTISYM    1.1429e-06          n/a          n/a   1.5253e-05
  T3_standstill_ I1 qdot^T H q   2.8376e-11   4.2059e-11   1.3683e-11   7.1725e-07
  T3_standstill_ I2 qddot^T H q   1.1303e-02   1.1303e-02   1.2214e-07   5.4659e-06
